  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63458712
  exerciseText: 'Crafting System capable of crafting items by following a certain
    Recipe and converting Input items into Output items. It works alongside an Inventory
    System that stores the Inputs and Outputs.


    In this Scenario there are UI
    buttons to add Items to the Inventory and buttons to craft various recipes like
    a Gold Ingot from multiple Gold Ores.


    <b>NOTE: Completing this Exercise
    will DELETE all the files, so if you want to keep your own personal implementation
    of this System then make a BACKUP before clicking on Complete Exercise!</b>'
